<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Brew a trendy, newer drink in the world of coffee rumored to originate from far off steamworlds. Coffee granules are rapidly mixed with sugar to form a thick, luxuriously sweet foam. Afterwards the foam is dispersed over deeply chilled milk before drinking.-->
  <VBE_BrewDalgonaCoffee.description>据说是从蒸汽世界传来的时髦玩意。咖啡里被快速与糖浆打在一起，形成一层厚厚的奶盖，再加入冰牛奶。</VBE_BrewDalgonaCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing dalgona coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewDalgonaCoffee.jobString>正在制作焦糖咖啡</VBE_BrewDalgonaCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew dalgona coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewDalgonaCoffee.label>制作焦糖咖啡</VBE_BrewDalgonaCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Brew a bitter espresso mixed with cream or milk, then further mixed with mint oil and garnished. Cool and velvety coffee gives way to an even cooler, soothing aftertaste, not to mention great smelling breath.-->
  <VBE_BrewMintCoffee.description>把苦涩的特浓咖啡混合奶油和薄荷油，并用薄荷叶装饰。非常绵软清爽的咖啡，回味无穷，还能带来清新口气。</VBE_BrewMintCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing mint coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewMintCoffee.jobString>正在制作薄荷咖啡</VBE_BrewMintCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew mint coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewMintCoffee.label>制作薄荷咖啡</VBE_BrewMintCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Make a light, citrusy green tea spiked with sugar to create a buttery, almost nutty flavor.-->
  <VBE_MakeGreenTea.description>在绿茶混入白糖，制作出一种既像牛奶也像坚果的味道。</VBE_MakeGreenTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making green tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeGreenTea.jobString>正在制作甜绿茶</VBE_MakeGreenTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make green tea-->
  <VBE_MakeGreenTea.label>制作甜绿茶</VBE_MakeGreenTea.label>
  <!--EN: Make a musty, warm, almost woody tea crafted by simple leaves and complex spices. Alleged to be good against high cholesterol.-->
  <VBE_MakeMasalaChai.description>用香料和粗茶叶做出一种浓稠辛辣的茶饮料。可以有效缓解胆固醇。</VBE_MakeMasalaChai.description>
  <!--EN: Making masala chai.-->
  <VBE_MakeMasalaChai.jobString>正在制作玛莎拉茶</VBE_MakeMasalaChai.jobString>
  <!--EN: make masala chai-->
  <VBE_MakeMasalaChai.label>制作玛莎拉茶</VBE_MakeMasalaChai.label>
  <!--EN: Make black tea leaves mixed with mint leaves and deeply steeped, then garnished with additional mint leaves. Leaves your breath surprisingly fresh.-->
  <VBE_MakeMintTea.description>把红茶叶和薄荷叶用开水冲泡，再加入额外的薄荷叶点缀。让你满口清香。</VBE_MakeMintTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making mint tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeMintTea.jobString>正在制作薄荷茶</VBE_MakeMintTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make mint tea-->
  <VBE_MakeMintTea.label>制作薄荷茶</VBE_MakeMintTea.label>
  <!--EN: Make an ancient Kashmiri tea mixing tea leaves, a pinch of salt and baking soda, which results in an striking pink beverage that is famous for being not only delicious but also healthy for the body. Very efficient for treating those with a high blood pressure.-->
  <VBE_MakeNoonChai.description>古代克什米尔的独特饮料，混合茶叶，盐和小苏打制作出一种奇特的粉红色饮料，美味又健康。适合用来缓解高血压。</VBE_MakeNoonChai.description>
  <!--EN: Making noon chai.-->
  <VBE_MakeNoonChai.jobString>正在制作下午茶</VBE_MakeNoonChai.jobString>
  <!--EN: make noon chai-->
  <VBE_MakeNoonChai.label>制作下午茶</VBE_MakeNoonChai.label>
</LanguageData>
